1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:05,306
I'm hungry!

5
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:08,436
Let's learn yummy fruits!

6
00:00:09,786 --> 00:00:11,834
This is an apple.

7
00:00:12,234 --> 00:00:14,774
Apple! Can you say apple?

8
00:00:16,174 --> 00:00:17,267
It is red,

9
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,031
round and crunchy.

10
00:00:20,381 --> 00:00:22,476
This is a banana.

11
00:00:22,876 --> 00:00:25,598
Banana! Can you say banana?

12
00:00:26,998 --> 00:00:28,187
It is yellow.

13
00:00:28,187 --> 00:00:29,451
Peel it first!

14
00:00:30,801 --> 00:00:32,539
What is this?

15
00:00:34,339 --> 00:00:35,730
Orange!

16
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,589
It is orange and juicy.

17
00:00:39,139 --> 00:00:40,571
Yum, yum!

18
00:00:41,921 --> 00:00:44,040
This is a strawberry.

19
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:47,403
Strawberry! Can you say strawberry?

20
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:50,899
It is red and sweet.

21
00:00:52,249 --> 00:00:54,106
These are grapes.

22
00:00:54,506 --> 00:00:56,945
Grapes! Can you say grapes?

23
00:00:58,345 --> 00:01:00,583
They are small and purple.

24
00:01:01,933 --> 00:01:03,671
What is this?

25
00:01:05,471 --> 00:01:07,125
Watermelon!

26
00:01:07,675 --> 00:01:10,794
It is green outside and red inside.

27
00:01:11,344 --> 00:01:12,775
Yum, yum!

28
00:01:14,125 --> 00:01:16,078
This is a pear.

29
00:01:16,478 --> 00:01:18,574
Pear! Can you say pear?

30
00:01:19,974 --> 00:01:22,117
It is green and sweet.

31
00:01:23,467 --> 00:01:26,088
Fruits are yummy and healthy!

32
00:01:26,638 --> 00:01:28,876
Great job, little learner!

33
00:01:29,426 --> 00:01:31,315
Share Mimzi with a friend,

34
00:01:31,315 --> 00:01:33,854
and subscribe for more learning fun!

35
00:01:34,404 --> 00:01:35,453
Next time,

36
00:01:35,453 --> 00:01:37,550
let's learn vegetables.

37
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,171
Bye bye!
